---
// src/components/home/InternationalPresence.astro
---

<section class="py-12 border-y border-black/5 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1290px] px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      
      <div class="space-y-2 max-w-xl text-center lg:text-left">
        <span class="font-ibm-plex-mono text-xs font-semibold text-opai-purple uppercase tracking-wider">
          Presencia & Cobertura Global
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-sora text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-background-13">
          Desde Colombia y Estados Unidos, trabajando con empresas sin fronteras.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-inter-tight text-sm sm:text-base text-background-13/70 leading-relaxed">
          Combinamos talento creativo de alto nivel, visión estratégica y ejecución tecnológica para colaborar de forma remota y fluida con compañías en múltiples industrias y husos horarios.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Country / Hub connection cards -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-slate-50 px-5 py-3.5 shadow-xs">
          <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-xl bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-xs">
            🇨🇴
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-sora text-sm font-semibold text-background-13 block leading-tight">Colombia Hub</span>
            <span class="font-ibm-plex-mono text-xs text-background-13/50">Medellín & Bogotá</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-opai-purple font-ibm-plex-mono text-lg font-bold">
          ⟷
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-slate-50 px-5 py-3.5 shadow-xs">
          <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-xl bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-xs">
            🇺🇸
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-sora text-sm font-semibold text-background-13 block leading-tight">United States</span>
            <span class="font-ibm-plex-mono text-xs text-background-13/50">Remote Global Ops</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
